# AGENT ACTIVITY LOG — verbose, append-only record of agent actions.

Timestamp (UTC) + one line per meaningful action: what started/finished,
decisions, errors, next steps. The short 1-line liveness timeline lives in
`status/status.log` (auto-written by the status-heartbeat every 10 min); THIS file
is the detailed "what the agent actually did" companion. The agent appends lines
while working; the status-heartbeat commits+pushes it with every tick.

